Ah, child, dreams are a curious thing. Sometimes they're a message from yer own mind, or mayhap a reflection of yer thoughts. A cup of warm milk before ye lay down might help settle yer stomach and ease yer mind. There are also herbs that can aid with sleep, like a tea of thyme will ease her chest. Go raibh maith agat for sharing yer troubles with me.
